00:04:08.452 --> 00:04:09.842
Look how far it went.

00:04:09.842 --> 00:04:11.782
Really quickly, as well.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.680
And bearing in mind, it
didn't get shot up in the air,

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.141
It just got shot along the floor.

00:04:16.141 --> 00:04:17.749
It, like, hit the floor sometimes.

00:04:21.507 --> 00:04:23.357
I'd say it is about 25 meters maybe.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.015
